    "message": "fix(allowed-tools): remove commas, use whitespace\n\nCommas are find for Claude, but both the spec and warden (via dotagents-lib) expect whitespace-separated tools. Warden has been quietly having trouble using anything but the first allowed tool.\n- https://agentskills.io/specification\n- https://github.com/getsentry/dotagents/blob/399121d28144c118883ade1815081e2db0830e91/packages/dotagents-lib/src/skills/loader.ts#L109",
